{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06346","headline":"东京寄万楚 · 李颀","name":"东京寄万楚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"濩落久无用，隐身甘采薇。\n仍闻薄宦者，还事田家衣。\n颍水日夜流，故人相见稀。\n春山不可望，黄鸟东南飞。\n濯足岂长往，一樽聊可依。\n了然潭上月，适我胷中机。\n在昔同门友，如今出处非。\n优游白虎殿，偃息青琐闱。\n且有荐君表，当看携手归。\n寄书不待面，兰茝空芳菲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}